        "html": "\u003cdiv class=\"mockup-component--long-details\">\n\u003csection class=\"long-section detail-section\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"section-heading\">\u003cspan class=\"section-number\">02\u003c/span>\u003cdiv>\u003ch2>상세 내용\u003c/h2>\u003cp>항목이 많은 표나 반복되는 내용을 화면 중간에 배치합니다.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"detail-table\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"detail-row detail-table-heading\">\u003cspan>항목\u003c/span>\u003cspan>내용\u003c/span>\u003cspan>보조 정보\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"detail-row\">\u003cstrong>첫 번째 항목\u003c/strong>\u003cspan class=\"soft-line\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"soft-line\">\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"detail-row\">\u003cstrong>두 번째 항목\u003c/strong>\u003cspan class=\"soft-line\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"soft-line\">\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"detail-row\">\u003cstrong>세 번째 항목\u003c/strong>\u003cspan class=\"soft-line\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"soft-line\">\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"detail-row\">\u003cstrong>네 번째 항목\u003c/strong>\u003cspan class=\"soft-line\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"soft-line\">\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"detail-row\">\u003cstrong>다섯 번째 항목\u003c/strong>\u003cspan class=\"soft-line\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"soft-line\">\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"detail-row\">\u003cstrong>여섯 번째 항목\u003c/strong>\u003cspan class=\"soft-line\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"soft-line\">\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cp class=\"section-tail\">화면의 너비는 일정하게 유지되고 아래로 내용이 이어집니다.\u003c/p>\n    \u003c/section>\n\u003c/div>",
        "css": ".mockup-component--long-details{display:flow-root;width:1152px;max-width:100%;}\n.mockup-component--long-details,.mockup-component--long-details *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.mockup-component--long-details{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;color:#2d3e56}\n.mockup-component--long-details{font-size:15px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .page-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2px;color:#8190a4}\n.mockup-component--long-details .page-top strong{font-size:15px;color:#435975;letter-spacing:1px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .sample-label{font-size:11px;color:#8b98a9;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #e1e6ed;border-radius:5px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .eyebrow{font-size:11px;color:#8d9caf;letter-spacing:1.3px;margin:45px 0 13px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .title{font-size:30px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-1.1px;font-weight:650;margin:0 0 13px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .intro{font-size:14px;color:#8794a6;line-height:1.9;margin:0}\n.mockup-component--long-details .divider{height:1px;background:#e8edf3;margin:32px 0}\n.mockup-component--long-details .footer{position:absolute;bottom:34px;left:64px;right:64px;border-top:1px solid #edf0f5;padding-top:15px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11px;color:#a0aab9}\n.mockup-component--long-details .tiny-label{font-size:10px;color:#93a0b3;letter-spacing:.8px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .number-box{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#edf2fa;color:#6b85ad;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:650}\n.mockup-component--long-details h2{font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.3px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .small-copy{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:#8a97a8;word-break:keep-all;margin:11px 0 0}\n.mockup-component--long-details .soft-line{height:9px;background:#edf1f6;border-radius:4px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .soft-block{background:#f5f7fa;border:1px solid #edf0f5;border-radius:6px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .page-top strong{letter-spacing:0}\n.mockup-component--long-details .eyebrow{margin-top:32px;letter-spacing:0}\n.mockup-component--long-details .long-content{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:72px;margin-top:52px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .long-section{border:1px solid #e1e7ef;border-radius:12px;padding:36px;background:#fff}\n.mockup-component--long-details .overview-section{height:450px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .detail-section{height:650px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .closing-section{height:710px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .section-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;margin-bottom:28px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .section-number{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:11px;background:#edf3fb;color:#5276a3;font-weight:650;font-size:15px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .section-heading p{margin:5px 0 0;color:#8190a3;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}\n.mockup-component--long-details .overview-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .overview-card{height:220px;padding:26px;border-radius:8px;background:#f6f8fb;border:1px solid #edf0f5}\n.mockup-component--long-details .overview-card h3{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}\n.mockup-component--long-details .overview-card p{margin:0;color:#8291a5;font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;word-break:keep-all}\n.mockup-component--long-details .overview-card .soft-line{margin-top:30px;width:84%}\n.mockup-component--long-details .overview-card .soft-line:last-child{margin-top:14px;width:60%}\n.mockup-component--long-details .section-tail{margin:23px 0 0;color:#8393a7;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8}\n.mockup-component--long-details .detail-table{border:1px solid #e3e9f1;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}\n.mockup-component--long-details .detail-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr 1.3fr;align-items:center;gap:25px;min-height:64px;padding:18px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #ebeff5;font-size:13px;color:#71849b}\n.mockup-component--long-details .detail-row:last-child{border-bottom:0}\n.mockup-component--long-details .detail-row strong{font-weight:550;color:#4d627d}\n.mockup-component--long-details .detail-table-heading{min-height:49px;background:#f5f7fa;font-size:12px;color:#7c8ea6}\n.mockup-component--long-details .detail-row .soft-line{height:7px;width:85%}\n.mockup-component--long-details .detail-row .soft-line:last-child{width:64%}\n.mockup-component--long-details .closing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:24px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .closing-card{height:338px;padding:27px;border:1px solid #e4eaf2;border-radius:8px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .closing-card h3{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 21px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .closing-card p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:#8492a5;margin:0 0 24px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .closing-card .soft-block{padding:23px;background:#f7f9fb}\n.mockup-component--long-details .closing-card .soft-line{margin-bottom:19px;height:8px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .closing-card .soft-line:last-child{margin-bottom:0;width:70%}\n.mockup-component--long-details .end-message{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin-top:28px;padding:28px;background:#f0f5fb;border:1px solid #dfe8f4;border-radius:8px;min-height:135px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .end-symbol{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:38px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:50%;color:#5d7ba4;background:#fff;font-size:19px}\n.mockup-component--long-details .end-message strong{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#48678f}\n.mockup-component--long-details .end-message p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:#7b8fa9;margin:7px 0 0}"
