">⌄\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003cbutton class=\"row-save\" type=\"button\" disabled>변경\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\u003c/section>\u003csection>\u003ch2 class=\"section-title\">물질·결과\u003c/h2>\u003cdiv class=\"field-row\">\u003cdiv class=\"field-name\">\u003clabel for=\"substance\">분석 물질 \u003cspan class=\"required-label\">[필수]\u003c/span>\u003c/label>\u003cspan class=\"source extracted\">추출됨\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"field-control\">\u003cinput id=\"substance\" type=\"text\" value=\"1-butanamine (109-73-9)\" disabled>\u003c/div>\u003cbutton class=\"row-save\" type=\"button\" disabled>변경\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"field-row\">\u003cdiv class=\"field-name\">\u003clabel for=\"result\">결과 \u003cspan class=\"required-label\">[필수]\u003c/span>\u003c/label>\u003cspan class=\"source extracted\">추출됨\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"field-control\">\u003cinput id=\"result\" type=\"text\" value=\"4.627399605208463\" disabled>\u003c/div>\u003cbutton class=\"row-save\" type=\"button\" disabled>변경\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"field-row\">\u003cdiv class=\"field-name\">\u003clabel for=\"unit\">단위 \u003cspan class=\"required-label\">[필수]\u003c/span>\u003c/label>\u003cspan class=\"source extracted\">추출됨\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"field-control\">\u003cdiv class=\"combo\">\u003cinput id=\"unit\" role=\"combobox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-autocomplete=\"list\" value=\"ppb\" placeholder=\"드롭다운, 혹은 검색 후 선택 가능합니다.\" disabled>\u003cspan class=\"chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⌄\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003cbutton class=\"row-save\" type=\"button\" disabled>변경\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\u003c/section>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\u003caside class=\"map-panel\" aria-label=\"지역 및 좌표\">\u003cdiv class=\"map-heading\">\u003ch2 class=\"map-title\">지역·관측 지점\u003c/h2>\u003cbutton class=\"region-add-button\" type=\"button\">신규 추가\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\u003clabel class=\"region-label\" for=\"region\">지역 검색\u003c/label>\u003cdiv class=\"combo\">\u003cinput id=\"region\" role=\"combobox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-autocomplete=\"list\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"드롭다운, 혹은 검색 후 선택 가능합니다.\">\u003cspan class=\"chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⌄\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n\u003cdiv class=\"map\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"선택된 위치가 없는 지도\">\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 408 278\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003crect width=\"408\" height=\"278\" fill=\"#e9eeeb\"/>\u003cpath d=\"M300 0h108v278H325l-37-93 25-73Z\" fill=\"#dbe7ee\"/>\u003cpath d=\"M0 20h128l-12 94L0 98Zm159 0h112l-15 90-92 8ZM0 141l112 4 21 133H0Zm153-8 109-9 33 154H166Z\" fill=\"#dbe3df\"/>\u003cpath d=\"M136-10 130 118l20 170M0 119l277-7M0 219l294-18\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"14\" fill=\"none\"/>\u003cpath d=\"M43 0v278M214 0l-6 278M0 61l281-8M0 168h283\" stroke=\"#f7f9f8\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\"/>\u003c/svg>\u003c/div>\n\u003cdiv class=\"coordinates\">\u003cdiv>\u003cdiv class=\"coordinate-label\">\u003clabel for=\"latitude\">위도 \u003cspan class=\"required-label\">[필수]\u003c/span>\u003c/label>\u003cspan class=\"source\">미추출\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cinput id=\"latitude\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"미입력\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv>\u003cdiv class=\"coordinate-label\">\u003clabel for=\"longitude\">경도 \u003cspan class=\"required-label\">[필수]\u003c/span>\u003c/label>\u003cspan class=\"source\">미추출\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\u003cinput id=\"longitude\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"미입력\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\u003cdiv class=\"map-save-actions\">\u003cbutton class=\"row-save\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"지역 및 좌표 변경\" disabled>변경\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\u003c/aside>\u003c/div>\u003cfooter class=\"footer\">\u003cdiv>\u003cdiv class=\"save-state\">변경 사항: 0개\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003cbutton class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" data-viewer-dialog=\"stage-save-dialog\">저장 후 상세 검토로 이동\u003c/button>\u003c/footer>\u003c/main>\u003cdialog class=\"stage-save-dialog\" id=\"stage-save-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"stage-dialog-title\" aria-describedby=\"stage-dialog-message\">\u003cdiv class=\"stage-dialog-body\">\u003ch2 id=\"stage-dialog-title\">2단계로 이동\u003c/h2>\u003cp id=\"stage-dialog-message\">변경 사항을 저장하고 2단계로 이동하시겠습니까?\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"stage-dialog-actions\">\u003cbutton type=\"button\" data-viewer-dialog-close>취소\u003c/button>\u003cbutton class=\"confirm\" type=\"button\" data-viewer-page=\"rist-phase2-review-detail\">저장 후 이동\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\u003c/dialog>\u003cscript>\n// Local mockup state only; no server or database write.\n(() => {\n  const rows = [...document.querySelectorAll('.field-row')];\n  const status = document.querySelector('.save-state');\n  const original = {};\n  const updateStatus = (savedNow = false) => {\n    const count = rows.filter(row => row.classList.contains('changed')).length;\n    status.textContent = `변경 사항: ${count}개`;\n  };\n  rows.forEach(row => {\n    const fields = [...row.querySelectorAll('input, select')];\n    const button = row.querySelector('.row-save');\n    let saved = fields.map(field => Object.hasOwn(original, field.id) ? original[field.id] : field.value);\n    const update = (savedNow = false) => {\n      const changed = fields.some((field, index) => field.value !== saved[index]);\n      row.classList.toggle('changed', changed);\n      button.disabled = !changed;\n      updateStatus(savedNow);\n    };\n    fields.forEach(field => { field.addEventListener('input', () => update()); field.addEventListener('change', () => update()); });\n    button.setAttribute('aria-label', row.querySelector('label').textContent + ' 변경');\n    button.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (!fields.every(field => field.checkValidity())) { fields.find(field => !field.checkValidity()).reportValidity(); return; }\n      saved = fields.map(field => field.value);\n      update(true);\n    });\n  });\n})();\n\u003c/script>\u003c/body>\u003c/html>",
