        "html": "\u003cdiv class=\"mockup-component--modal-medium\">\n\u003carticle class=\"modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"medium-title\">\u003cheader class=\"modal-header\">\u003ch3 id=\"medium-title\">매체 신규 추가\u003c/h3>\u003cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"close\" aria-label=\"매체 신규 추가 닫기\">×\u003c/button>\u003c/header>\u003cdiv class=\"modal-body\">\u003cdiv class=\"field\">\u003clabel for=\"medium-name\">매체명\u003cspan class=\"required\">필수\u003c/span>\u003c/label>\u003cinput id=\"medium-name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"매체명 입력\" required>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"field\">\u003clabel for=\"medium-note\">비고\u003cspan class=\"optional\">선택\u003c/span>\u003c/label>\u003ctextarea id=\"medium-note\" placeholder=\"비고 입력\">\u003c/textarea>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003cfooter class=\"modal-footer\">\u003cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"button\">취소\u003c/button>\u003cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"button primary\" disabled>등록 후 선택\u003c/button>\u003c/footer>\u003c/article>\n\u003c/div>",
